<div class="row column faq">
	<div class="grid grid-faq">
		<div class="fmp-page1 align-center">
			<div class="row row-heading heading-white" style="width: 100%">
				<div class="column">
					<h1 class="section-heading">Become a Founding Member of iDAL</h1>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="row">
				<div class="column">
					<p>Our Founding Member Programme brings together industry leading brands that are passionate about raising the ethical standards of fashion.</p>
					<p>Founding members will be eligible for exclusive iDAL benefits, and commit to being ambassadors of positive change in the way brands and creatives work with models.</p>
					<p>Let’s shape the future of fashion together, where models and brands are empowered to make their own decisions while technology helps both to do so in a safe and transparent environment. </p>
					<p>Be part of <em>something great</em>. Apply below.</p>
					<p>&nbsp;</p>
					<button class="button burgundy fmp-apply">Apply</button>
					<div class="seperator" data-gap="4"></div>
					<div class="seperator" data-gap="4"></div>
				</div>
			</div>
		
		</div>
		<div class="fmp-page2">
			<div class="row row-heading heading-white" style="width: 100%">
				<div class="column align-center">
					<h1 class="section-heading">Become a Founding Member</h1>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="row">
				<div class="column align-center">
					<p><em>By applying to become a Founding Member of iDAL, you accept and agree to the <a href="/conduct">iDAL Code of Conduct</a>.</em></p>
					<p><em>You commit to help and support us on our mission to empower brands and models to work together in a safe and transparent environment.</em></p>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="row">
				<div class="column">
					<h2>In return for your help you will be eligible for:</h2>
					<ul>
						<li>0% commission for bookings with iDAL for the first 6 months</li>
						<li>Direct personal support for casting and booking models</li>
						<li>Tailored replacement options in case of cancellations</li>
						<li>Payments online and by invoice</li>
						<li>Sponsored rewards</li>
						<li>Opportunity to participate in the private iDAL community events as speakers, sponsors or guests</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
			</div>
			
			<div class="row">
				<div class="column">
					<form id="founderapplication" method="post" action="/foundingmembers" >
						<table>
							<tr>
								<td class="text-right text-bold">I apply on behalf of:</td>
								<td><input type="text" name="client_company" placeholder="brand, company or an individual"/></td>
							</tr>
							<tr>
								<td class="text-right">My full name:</td>
								<td><input type="text" name="client_name" /></td>
							</tr>
							<tr>
								<td class="text-right">Work email:</td>
								<td><input type="text" name="client_email" /></td>
							</tr>
							<tr>
								<td class="text-right">Phone number:</td>
								<td><input type="text" name="client_phone" /></td>
							</tr>
							<tr>
								<td class="text-right">Work address:</td>
								<td><input type="text" name="client_address" /></td>
							</tr>
							<tr>
								<td class="text-right">Website:</td>
								<td><input type="text" name="client_website" /></td>
							</tr>
							<tr>
								<td class="text-right">Location:</td>
								<td><input type="text" name="client_location" /></td>
							</tr>
						</table>
					</form>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="seperator" data-gap="4"></div>
			<div class="row">
				<div class="column align-center"><div class="button burgundy fmpapply">Send my application</div></div>
			</div>
			<div class="seperator" data-gap="4"></div>
			<div class="seperator" data-gap="4"></div>
			<div class="seperator" data-gap="4"></div>
		</div>
		<div class="dots">
			<div class="fancydots_left"><img src="/images/fancy_dots.png" /></div>
			<div class="fancydots_right"><img src="/images/fancy_dots.png" /></div>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>